{"product_id":"dinner-lady-salts-flip-flop-lychee","title":"Dinner Lady Salts Flip Flop Lychee","description":"\u003cp\u003eFlip Flop Lychee by Dinner Lady is an exotic blend of Asian Lychees, citrus, and ice. Do you love fruity vape juice flavors? Are you ready to try something that’s a little different? If so, Dinner Lady has a flavor that you are going to love. Flip Flop Lychee vape juice is a succulent blend of sweet lychee flavor, stunning citrus fruits and a cold shot of menthol. This flavor extravaganza will refresh your palate with every inhale and exhale.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is the middle of summer, meaning that we are all craving those refreshing fruity flavors more than ever. Thankfully, Dinner Lady has come to our rescue with Flip Flop Lychee vape juice. Flip Flop Lychee is a yummy liquid that is exploding with exotic and bright fruity goodness that will make your palate feel absolutely refreshed and satisfied after just one puff.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuantity: 30ml e liquid concentrated with nicotine.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength: \u003cem\u003e50mg and 30mg\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ci\u003e50% VG\/ 50% PG\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"30MG","offer_id":41762050277431,"sku":"69d2600a0e568","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41762050310199,"sku":"69d2600a9a6f7","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Dinner-Lady-Salts-Flip-Flop-Lychee-Vape-Shop.jpg?v=1751854487","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/dinner-lady-salts-flip-flop-lychee","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




